stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Any declared command status" as AnyStatus
    state "Save rejected" as Rejected

    [*] --> AnyStatus: create execution with any status
    AnyStatus --> AnyStatus: same command and non-older timestamp
    AnyStatus --> Rejected: changed command definition
    AnyStatus --> Rejected: older timestamp
    Rejected --> AnyStatus: stored snapshot unchanged

    note right of AnyStatus
        PENDING · SENT · ACKNOWLEDGED
        COMPLETED · FAILED · EXPIRED

        No lifecycle transitions are enforced.
    end note
